  "details": "Since I heard that VRChat is coming to Oculus Quest. (IN YOUR FACE SNAPDRAGON!!!! >:D) There might be some issues with performance for the game. Thankfully, I have a suggestion that might be helpful for Quest users.\n\n\"Oculus Quest Optimized\" is a special tag where you run certain tests on avatars and worlds (Mostly worlds) on the Quest, then give out feedback on how to improve the avatars and worlds to optimize it for the Quest. But if it runs really smooth enough, the team will slap in a special tag to let them know that avatars and worlds are optimized enough for Oculus Quest.\n\nSounds reasonable? Let me know your thoughts about it down below.",
